<a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-10-25/apple-to-unveil-touch-screen-macbook-pro-executive-promotions-in-box-checker"><em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman today reported</a> that Apple is facing a growing problem where some people will buy iPhones or other products and either remove accessories from the box, open up the device and remove components, and/or remove the entire device, and then attempt to return the box hoping that the employee will not notice.<br/>
<br/>
